  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 2 April 2025). Our client Ashok Chandran is a 48-year-old fashion designer who lives at Bungalow 22, Keshwapur, Hubballi 580047 and can be reached on 73452 22254 or ashok.chandran76@example.com. The client's PAN QQSPC5805A.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Pranav Mukherjee. A cheque for INR 8,75,000/- issued by Pranav Mukherjee bounced: the cheque was dishonoured because the signature did not match.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 819013304648 (IFSC ICIC0784383).\nThe matter was filed as S.C.C. No. 1737/2025 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Hubballi on 5 October 2025.",
